{
  "version": 1,
  "note": "改动面分级：AI 该不该自己拍板，由这张表判，不靠人记。规则实现见 scripts/change_policy.py。",
  "approve_label": "approved:contract",
  "big_diff_label": "approved:big-diff",
  "tiers": [
    {
      "tier": "L3",
      "paths": ["src/bundle.rs", "src/journal.rs", "src/model.rs"],
      "why": "对外格式（包/哈希链/提交对象形状）：改了别人的旧包与旧提交就读不动，必须人拍板。变异台账另算 —— 只有删条目要人批。"
    },
    {
      "tier": "L2",
      "paths": ["src/**", "tests/**", "examples/**", "Cargo.toml", "Cargo.lock"],
      "why": "产品代码与其测试：AI 可以改，但必须带证据（测试改动 + 读数 + 新判定登记变异）。"
    },
    {
      "tier": "L1",
      "paths": [".github/**", "scripts/**"],
      "why": "CI/CD 与门脚本：鼓励 AI 自己动 —— 但门脚本必须有 --self-test，且改动要能被变异门杀到。"
    },
    {
      "tier": "L0",
      "paths": ["**/*.md", "docs/**"],
      "why": "文档：最低门，机器只查形状。"
    }
  ],
  "frozen_markers": [
    {
      "path": "src/bundle.rs",
      "why": "TVBD 包的 magic 与 schema：中央仓、镜像、别人的旧包都按这两行解读",
      "must_contain": ["pub const MAGIC: &[u8; 4] = b\"TVBD\";", "pub const SCHEMA: u32 = 1;"]
    },
    {
      "path": "src/journal.rs",
      "why": "哈希链的证据字段：去掉 prev 就不是「改分支留痕」，审计面整个失效",
      "must_contain": ["pub prev: Option<Hash>,"]
    },
    {
      "path": "src/model.rs",
      "why": "提交对象的 schema 号：它被写进别人的仓与包，改号 = 历史读不动",
      "must_contain": ["pub const COMMIT_SCHEMA: u32 = 1;"]
    },
    {
      "path": "Cargo.toml",
      "why": "MSRV 与依赖正本（trit-core/trit-orch 的 pin rev）：换 pin 就是换语义来源",
      "must_contain": ["rust-version = \"1.88\"", "rev = \"2400fb9d2de751cab358455e3bf622b7a3288f1c\""]
    }
  ],
  "limits": {"max_l2_files": 25, "max_added_lines": 2500},
  "test_evidence": {
    "watch": ["src/"],
    "test_paths": ["tests/"],
    "escape": "NO-TEST-NEEDED:"
  }
}
